WEBVTT

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:38.000
=Episode 19=

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:38.719
(Commander,)

00:01:38.719 --> 00:01:39.599
(Li Mao has taken poison.)

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:39.920
Commander.

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:40.280
Commander.

00:01:41.799 --> 00:01:42.120
Commander.

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:42.519
Commander.

00:01:53.599 --> 00:01:54.640
Who else did he see?

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:13.319
The secrets of the capital

00:02:14.639 --> 00:02:18.439
Aren't yours to uncover.

00:02:19.319 --> 00:02:21.199
Didn't you want to know

00:02:21.199 --> 00:02:23.919
Who's really behind me?

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:27.599
Now that

00:02:27.599 --> 00:02:29.039
I'm dying,

00:02:30.039 --> 00:02:31.919
You're done for, too.

00:02:33.479 --> 00:02:35.360
Investigating beyond your authority,

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:37.840
Driving an official to his death...

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:40.240
Just wait.

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:42.759
You'll be

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:44.960
Joining me soon enough.

00:02:57.319 --> 00:02:58.520
Do you really think

00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:00.680
A confession

00:03:07.159 --> 00:03:09.719
Would've helped me more than your death?

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:52.080
(Xie Residence)

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:52.960
(Virtue Blesses the Hometown)

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:53.759
Miss Xie.

00:03:54.319 --> 00:03:55.879
Congratulations, Miss Xie.

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:56.879
I came

00:03:56.879 --> 00:03:58.360
Especially to congratulate you.

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:04.120
I'm almost embarrassed to say it.

00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:05.000
That house next door

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:06.719
I showed you before

00:04:06.719 --> 00:04:08.360
Turned out to belong to a corrupt official.

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:10.520
The authorities seized it today.

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:12.479
Good thing fortune was on your side.

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:14.719
Just look at the house you bought instead.

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:15.719
It's far more

00:04:15.879 --> 00:04:17.079
Impressive than the one next door.

00:05:00.639 --> 00:05:01.600
Miss, look.

00:05:01.839 --> 00:05:03.519
Assistant Commander Zhao

00:05:03.519 --> 00:05:05.199
Is leading men to raid the house next door.

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:16.000
When it comes to choosing a house,

00:05:16.079 --> 00:05:17.439
You need a good eye.

00:05:17.959 --> 00:05:19.759
And you've certainly got one, Miss Xie.

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:21.199
Good thing

00:05:21.199 --> 00:05:22.720
You didn't choose the place next door.

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:24.199
If you had,

00:05:24.199 --> 00:05:25.600
We'd be in real trouble now.

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:26.480
Right, Miss Xie?

00:05:59.879 --> 00:06:00.560
They won't let us watch?

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:01.639
This must be serious.

00:06:04.199 --> 00:06:05.600
What on earth did they do?

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:06.120
Miss Xie,

00:06:06.399 --> 00:06:07.199
Let's go back.

00:06:07.199 --> 00:06:09.120
We still have guests waiting inside.

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:41.079
Miss Xie,

00:06:41.079 --> 00:06:41.879
It's getting chilly.

00:06:41.879 --> 00:06:42.839
Let's go inside.

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:48.959
The storm brewing in the capital

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:51.920
Is finally coming.

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:02.680
I'm innocent!

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:03.079
Move!

00:07:03.079 --> 00:07:03.879
Commander Zhao!

00:07:03.879 --> 00:07:04.839
Please, spare us!

00:07:04.839 --> 00:07:05.319
Move!

00:07:05.399 --> 00:07:06.720
(Xu Residence) I'm innocent!

00:07:06.720 --> 00:07:07.439
Master!

00:07:07.439 --> 00:07:07.920
Kneel!

00:07:08.680 --> 00:07:09.079
Kneel!

00:07:09.079 --> 00:07:10.199
Master!

00:07:10.199 --> 00:07:11.160
Commander Zhao!

00:07:11.439 --> 00:07:13.519
I'm innocent!

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:17.360
I didn't do it!

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:19.120
Commander Zhao!

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:20.680
Commander Zhao!

00:07:20.759 --> 00:07:21.959
Commander Zhao!

00:07:22.079 --> 00:07:24.480
Please spare us, Commander Zhao!

00:07:24.759 --> 00:07:25.600
Commander Zhao!

00:07:25.959 --> 00:07:27.959
Please spare me!

00:07:28.199 --> 00:07:29.160
Master!

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:31.399
Please spare me, Commander Zhao!

00:07:32.519 --> 00:07:33.680
Commander Zhao!

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:47.480
♪The past brushes by like a falling leaf♪

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:55.280
♪So light, yet my steps still pause for you♪

00:07:57.720 --> 00:08:02.040
♪Through every rise and fall, our memories remain without regret♪

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:04.840
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:11.000
♪How I wish I could stay a little longer, but I can't♪

00:08:14.280 --> 00:08:21.120
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill my eyes with tears♪

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:28.720
♪Etched deep within my heart, yet buried without a word♪

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:32.640
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:37.360
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:43.480
♪One promise for a lifetime, echoing long after we part♪

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:58.960
♪The past brushes by like a falling leaf♪

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:06.920
♪So light, yet my steps still pause for you♪

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:13.640
♪Through every rise and fall, our memories remain without regret♪

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:16.480
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

00:09:18.799 --> 00:09:20.679
(My fate is uncertain now.)

00:09:21.480 --> 00:09:22.960
(If I give in and see her,)

00:09:24.039 --> 00:09:26.679
(I'll only put her in harm's way.)

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:30.919
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you in the crowd♪

00:09:30.919 --> 00:09:31.720
Commander Zhao!

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:51.960
Master!

00:09:57.160 --> 00:10:04.080
♪If we can build our future together, no storm can chill my heart♪

00:10:04.639 --> 00:10:05.639
Go that way.

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:09.000
Take the long way around.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:13.440
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:18.120
♪One promise for a lifetime, echoing long after we part♪

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:23.519
Move.

00:10:23.840 --> 00:10:24.320
Move.

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:28.360
Move.

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:41.440
(Yu Residence)

00:10:45.559 --> 00:10:46.320
Madam,

00:10:46.519 --> 00:10:47.960
I've confirmed it.

00:10:48.440 --> 00:10:49.440
The one who bought the house

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:51.480
Was indeed Ninth Young Lady Fu.

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:54.960
Her?

00:10:57.519 --> 00:10:59.799
She's put down roots in the northwest these past few years,

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:02.240
And she's gotten much more capable.

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:05.600
She knows exactly where to strike to do the most damage.

00:11:06.519 --> 00:11:08.279
With her helping Zhao Ling,

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:12.279
No wonder he gets things done so quickly.

00:11:12.919 --> 00:11:14.240
I think

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:15.559
It's better to mend old grudges

00:11:15.559 --> 00:11:16.399
Than deepen them.

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:19.320
Why not use Young Master Ji's first-birthday banquet

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:20.200
As an occasion to send an invitation

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:22.080
And ask the Ninth Young Lady to come talk?

00:11:23.519 --> 00:11:25.039
The Ninth Young Lady...

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:27.519
Here.

00:11:30.039 --> 00:11:30.799
Young Madam.

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:35.080
I heard Miss Xie moved into her new home today

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:36.679
And held quite a housewarming celebration.

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:39.840
Where did she settle?

00:11:40.360 --> 00:11:41.720
Shijia Hutong.

00:11:42.279 --> 00:11:44.000
The very house you had your eye on.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:02.720
She has no one to rely on,

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:05.840
And only just arrived in the capital,

00:12:06.519 --> 00:12:08.919
Yet she can already afford a house beside the Imperial Academy.

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:10.879
She can afford it,

00:12:11.279 --> 00:12:12.360
But I can't?

00:12:13.720 --> 00:12:14.679
But now,

00:12:14.679 --> 00:12:16.279
You're the Young Madam of the Yu family.

00:12:16.639 --> 00:12:17.639
In birth,

00:12:17.879 --> 00:12:18.799
Education,

00:12:19.039 --> 00:12:19.799
And marriage,

00:12:20.279 --> 00:12:21.799
How could she possibly compare to you?

00:12:22.519 --> 00:12:23.519
She's nothing more than

00:12:23.519 --> 00:12:25.159
A woman who ran away with a man

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:27.159
Only to be abandoned by him.

00:12:27.639 --> 00:12:28.879
That mouth of yours...

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:36.200
Young Madam.

00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:38.600
A visiting card came from the wife of an Anzhou merchant.

00:12:38.679 --> 00:12:40.240
They say she's from Madam Yu's hometown.

00:12:40.240 --> 00:12:42.120
She sent me to let you know.

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:43.799
She'd like you to receive them.

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:52.320
I am Sun of the Wu family, and this is my niece.

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:53.879
Greetings, Young Madam Yu.

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:59.039
I've long heard that you excel at both poetry and painting.

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:00.840
(Madam Wu, Salt Merchant from Anzhou) After arriving in the capital,

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:02.639
I realized that all the young ladies in the city

00:13:02.799 --> 00:13:04.360
Couldn't stop praising

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:05.720
The literary gatherings you host.

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:06.919
Madam Yu

00:13:06.919 --> 00:13:08.639
Certainly gained a wonderful daughter-in-law.

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:11.200
You flatter me, Madam Wu.

00:13:11.679 --> 00:13:12.840
Our family business is modest.

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:14.360
Besides salt,

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:15.960
We also trade in medicinal herbs.

00:13:16.159 --> 00:13:17.279
By good fortune,

00:13:17.399 --> 00:13:19.360
We recently acquired these two rare purple lingzhi mushrooms.

00:13:19.679 --> 00:13:21.600
They're for Madam Yu's health.

00:13:21.799 --> 00:13:23.279
I hope you'll accept them.

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:25.320
That's very kind of you, Madam Wu.

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:27.320
Mother told me to see

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:29.200
That you were well received.

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:31.960
And this is for you, Young Madam.

00:13:39.159 --> 00:13:40.120
What is it?

00:13:40.279 --> 00:13:41.519
Anzhou's waters

00:13:41.519 --> 00:13:43.320
Produce some especially fine dried fish.

00:13:43.559 --> 00:13:44.600
Before I came,

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:45.840
I had ten catties prepared

00:13:45.919 --> 00:13:47.519
For you to enjoy.

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:51.080
Young Madam,

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:52.799
This dried fish from Anzhou

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:53.879
Sells

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:56.200
For dozens of taels per catty here in the capital.

00:13:57.559 --> 00:13:59.440
You'll finish it in just a couple of meals.

00:13:59.919 --> 00:14:01.039
No need to put it in storage.

00:14:06.480 --> 00:14:08.200
You certainly know how to choose an unusual gift, Madam Wu.

00:14:09.039 --> 00:14:10.039
I hear

00:14:10.039 --> 00:14:10.919
Other residences

00:14:10.919 --> 00:14:11.960
Are a bit larger.

00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:13.840
But you've come a long way to the capital.

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:15.639
Why not stay here with us?

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:17.679
Thank you, Young Madam.

00:14:17.840 --> 00:14:18.559
Mozhan.

00:14:19.159 --> 00:14:20.799
Have the maids prepare everything properly.

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:22.480
See that our guests are well looked after.

00:14:22.639 --> 00:14:23.240
Yes.

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:41.600
Are you wearing the orchid fragrance?

00:14:44.159 --> 00:14:45.200
Take off your veil.

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:47.360
Lift your head. Let me see you.

00:14:54.039 --> 00:14:55.080
Young Madam told you to remove it.

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:55.840
Do it now.

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:11.240
(Miss Wu)

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:31.799
Please wait here a moment.

00:15:31.799 --> 00:15:33.000
I'll have the carriage brought around

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:35.480
To take you both to our residence in the west of the city.

00:15:37.559 --> 00:15:38.440
Thank you.

00:15:45.919 --> 00:15:47.399
You were far too careless.

00:16:07.919 --> 00:16:09.159
Young Master loves orchids,

00:16:09.519 --> 00:16:10.759
And she just happens to wear orchid fragrance.

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:13.000
Clearly she was trying to seduce him.

00:16:14.159 --> 00:16:16.080
Good thing nothing escapes your eye, Young Madam.

00:16:16.440 --> 00:16:17.080
Otherwise,

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:18.759
She might actually have gotten away with it.

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:21.679
When I first married Young Master,

00:16:22.720 --> 00:16:24.159
I was about her age too.

00:16:25.159 --> 00:16:26.480
Sixteen or seventeen,

00:16:27.360 --> 00:16:28.559
Young and pretty.

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:30.960
What man wouldn't like that?

00:16:32.960 --> 00:16:34.519
Where did Madam Wu come from again?

00:16:35.279 --> 00:16:36.000
Anzhou.

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:38.240
Anzhou...

00:16:39.360 --> 00:16:41.000
I've heard the salt merchants there

00:16:41.559 --> 00:16:43.279
Buy young girls from entertainment houses

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:45.600
And train them specifically to please men.

00:16:46.279 --> 00:16:47.399
They call them "trained courtesans."

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:50.360
Tell me,

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:54.039
Why would she parade a girl like that

00:16:54.039 --> 00:16:55.519
Right in front of Mother?

00:16:55.799 --> 00:16:57.600
And she dares call herself a young lady?

00:16:58.039 --> 00:16:59.480
What kind of "young lady" is she?

00:17:00.679 --> 00:17:02.679
Now even common merchants

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:04.920
Dare scheme against me.

00:17:05.839 --> 00:17:07.799
All because my birth family has little influence

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:08.960
And no powerful connections.

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:15.319
Fine.

00:17:16.599 --> 00:17:18.000
For Ji's birthday banquet,

00:17:18.440 --> 00:17:19.799
I'm going to make it a grand affair.

00:17:21.079 --> 00:17:23.160
I want everyone to see

00:17:25.759 --> 00:17:28.279
If I'm the real Young Madam Yu.

00:17:34.840 --> 00:17:38.000
(Virtue Blesses the Hometown)

00:17:45.319 --> 00:17:46.000
Miss Xie.

00:17:46.319 --> 00:17:47.559
Someone from the Yu family brought this.

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:48.759
They said it's

00:17:48.759 --> 00:17:50.359
An invitation to Young Master Ji's first-birthday banquet.

00:17:51.079 --> 00:17:53.000
You just snatched that house out from under Young Madam Yu,

00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:55.039
On top of all your old grudges.

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:57.200
This is obviously a trap.

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:00.840
(Invitation)

00:18:08.359 --> 00:18:10.839
The only way to find out how treacherous the capital's social circles are

00:18:11.920 --> 00:18:14.200
And what the Yu family is planning with this banquet

00:18:14.599 --> 00:18:16.599
Is to go see for myself.

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:25.120
(Invitation from the Yu Residence)

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:36.240
Young Madam Yu is famously possessive.

00:18:36.400 --> 00:18:38.359
Even Mozhan, who was merely somewhat pretty,

00:18:38.359 --> 00:18:40.079
Was married off early.

00:18:40.079 --> 00:18:41.039
And you...

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:42.759
You went and hit her right where she's most sensitive.

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:44.400
Madam,

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:45.880
Her waist has grown by half a cun.

00:18:52.119 --> 00:18:53.839
No dinner

00:18:53.839 --> 00:18:54.599
For the next two weeks.

00:18:56.680 --> 00:18:57.480
Yes.

00:18:58.319 --> 00:18:58.920
Madam,

00:18:59.039 --> 00:19:00.440
The Yu family sent an invitation

00:19:00.440 --> 00:19:01.880
(Invitation) to Young Master Ji's birthday banquet.

00:19:08.839 --> 00:19:10.240
The Yu family's banquet

00:19:10.240 --> 00:19:11.440
Will be full of powerful guests.

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:12.759
You know exactly

00:19:12.759 --> 00:19:13.799
What's at stake.

00:19:14.079 --> 00:19:15.640
If you make another mistake,

00:19:16.279 --> 00:19:18.799
Don't blame me for being harsh with you.

00:19:20.279 --> 00:19:20.960
I understand.

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:24.799
Prepare two fine outfits for Miss Wu.

00:19:25.839 --> 00:19:26.440
Yes.

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:27.519
Tomorrow,

00:19:27.799 --> 00:19:29.559
I'll find you a good household to marry into.

00:19:32.160 --> 00:19:32.640
Let's go.

00:19:41.519 --> 00:19:42.880
Madam spends every day

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:44.400
Sending gifts to rich and powerful families,

00:19:44.920 --> 00:19:46.759
Yet she won't even let you eat properly

00:19:47.359 --> 00:19:49.160
Or give you decent clothes.

00:19:50.319 --> 00:19:52.519
You've come here only to suffer.

00:19:55.599 --> 00:19:57.839
But she's right about one thing.

00:19:59.839 --> 00:20:01.839
If I can marry a good man,

00:20:03.319 --> 00:20:04.680
I can finally escape her.

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:06.680
(Yu Residence) Congratulations!

00:20:06.759 --> 00:20:07.559
Thank you, Madam.

00:20:07.559 --> 00:20:08.160
Please, come inside.

00:20:08.160 --> 00:20:09.039
Careful with that.

00:20:09.599 --> 00:20:10.000
Of course.

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:11.480
Here. Put this away.

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:12.039
This way, Madam.

00:20:13.039 --> 00:20:13.680
Please.

00:20:18.119 --> 00:20:18.960
This way, please.

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:19.799
Okay.

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:22.400
Sister.

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:24.559
I could hear the firecrackers

00:20:24.559 --> 00:20:26.880
From two streets away.

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:29.400
You've certainly made Ji's celebration

00:20:29.400 --> 00:20:31.240
Both grand and auspicious.

00:20:31.359 --> 00:20:32.480
You flatter me.

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:35.480
It's been quite some time.

00:20:35.799 --> 00:20:37.359
How have you been lately, Old Madam?

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:39.000
I've been very well.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:40.119
(Old Madam Wei)

00:20:40.119 --> 00:20:42.000
My daughter-in-law often speaks of you.

00:20:42.079 --> 00:20:43.839
She says you handle everything

00:20:43.839 --> 00:20:45.400
With great care and elegance.

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:47.640
Seeing this banquet today,

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:49.480
I can see she was absolutely right.

00:20:49.480 --> 00:20:50.799
Thank you for your kind words, Old Madam.

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:51.880
Please, this way.

00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:54.160
Please.

00:21:02.279 --> 00:21:03.279
(Yu Residence) How grand.

00:21:04.920 --> 00:21:06.039
It really is magnificent.

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:08.160
Why is she here?

00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:09.599
Young Madam,

00:21:09.839 --> 00:21:11.759
Ms. Shu personally went to Shijia Hutong

00:21:11.759 --> 00:21:12.960
To deliver the invitation.

00:21:15.039 --> 00:21:16.440
This is my son's first-birthday banquet.

00:21:17.119 --> 00:21:18.400
Why invite her?

00:21:22.599 --> 00:21:24.119
Are Madam Wu

00:21:24.119 --> 00:21:25.079
And Miss Wu

00:21:25.079 --> 00:21:25.920
From Anzhou

00:21:26.519 --> 00:21:27.839
Coming too?

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:28.920
Yes.

00:21:39.759 --> 00:21:40.920
Of all days, the palace banquet

00:21:40.920 --> 00:21:42.799
Falls on the Young Master Ji's first birthday.

00:21:42.799 --> 00:21:44.000
And we can't very well ask to be excused.

00:21:48.920 --> 00:21:49.759
This way, please.

00:22:05.559 --> 00:22:06.400
She's here.

00:22:14.559 --> 00:22:16.759
Who's in charge of the cooking today?

00:22:17.359 --> 00:22:18.440
From Cuixi House.

00:22:20.160 --> 00:22:21.119
Add a dish of sesame flatbread.

00:22:23.079 --> 00:22:23.599
Yes.

00:22:37.640 --> 00:22:38.720
What's this?

00:22:38.839 --> 00:22:40.200
Young Master arranged it.

00:22:43.720 --> 00:22:44.720
Ladies,

00:22:45.359 --> 00:22:47.440
My husband once went on an inspection tour in the northwest.

00:22:47.559 --> 00:22:48.559
When he returned to the capital,

00:22:48.559 --> 00:22:49.799
He brought back some local specialties

00:22:49.799 --> 00:22:50.720
For me to try.

00:22:52.000 --> 00:22:53.640
I especially liked this sesame flatbread.

00:22:54.039 --> 00:22:55.319
He's always been thoughtful,

00:22:55.880 --> 00:22:56.960
So he remembered.

00:22:58.079 --> 00:23:00.000
Young Lord Yu is so considerate.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:02.119
How enviable.

00:23:02.279 --> 00:23:03.559
Then let's have a taste.

00:23:03.559 --> 00:23:04.240
Yes.

00:23:11.920 --> 00:23:13.920
I hear Commander Zhao has been back in the capital for some time

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:15.599
And hasn't even come to see you.

00:23:15.799 --> 00:23:17.000
Could it be that

00:23:17.000 --> 00:23:18.240
Now that he's risen in rank,

00:23:18.720 --> 00:23:21.000
He's forgotten the woman who stood by him through hardship?

00:23:22.640 --> 00:23:24.200
We have many distinguished ladies here today,

00:23:24.400 --> 00:23:26.359
All from prominent households.

00:23:26.759 --> 00:23:28.200
Shall I make some introductions

00:23:28.440 --> 00:23:29.599
And help you find a husband,

00:23:30.079 --> 00:23:31.480
So you don't waste your youth?

00:23:31.920 --> 00:23:32.839
Watch

00:23:32.839 --> 00:23:34.279
Your mouth! I...

00:23:39.599 --> 00:23:40.880
Have you noticed

00:23:41.160 --> 00:23:42.240
That right now,

00:23:42.440 --> 00:23:43.160
You sound remarkably like

00:23:43.160 --> 00:23:44.759
Someone we both know?

00:23:52.039 --> 00:23:53.799
If you were truly happy with your life,

00:23:54.720 --> 00:23:56.319
Why come flaunting it in front of me

00:23:56.319 --> 00:23:57.960
Like some proud rooster?

00:24:02.440 --> 00:24:03.799
I wouldn't call it flaunting.

00:24:04.400 --> 00:24:05.960
I'm simply living an ordinary life.

00:24:05.960 --> 00:24:07.480
I didn't realize that, in your eyes,

00:24:07.799 --> 00:24:09.119
Even that counted as showing off.

00:24:12.079 --> 00:24:14.119
If you're genuinely happy,

00:24:14.400 --> 00:24:16.160
After all our years as close friends,

00:24:16.720 --> 00:24:18.319
Of course I'd be happy for you.

00:24:19.079 --> 00:24:20.839
But sometimes, when I think of the past,

00:24:21.200 --> 00:24:23.119
I can't help feeling it's a shame.

00:24:23.880 --> 00:24:25.759
You, Fan Yake,

00:24:27.000 --> 00:24:29.039
Once became famous throughout Huaying

00:24:29.039 --> 00:24:31.400
With a single painting of narcissus flowers.

00:24:38.279 --> 00:24:40.680
But now, on your teacup...

00:24:42.880 --> 00:24:44.119
Are those still narcissus flowers?

00:24:48.240 --> 00:24:48.839
Change them.

00:24:49.119 --> 00:24:50.880
Madam Yu specifically ordered it.

00:24:51.440 --> 00:24:52.240
You may go.

00:24:53.880 --> 00:24:54.599
Young Madam,

00:24:55.039 --> 00:24:56.480
Everyone in the capital knows

00:24:56.640 --> 00:24:58.359
Young Master loves orchids most.

00:24:58.720 --> 00:25:00.039
Madam Yu arranged this

00:25:00.319 --> 00:25:01.400
Because she cares for you.

00:25:05.839 --> 00:25:07.400
Go fetch Madam Wu.

00:25:08.519 --> 00:25:10.119
The real show is about to begin.

00:25:10.880 --> 00:25:11.519
Yes.

00:25:15.559 --> 00:25:17.680
This young lady comes from my mother-in-law's hometown.

00:25:18.160 --> 00:25:19.000
Her surname is Wu.

00:25:20.839 --> 00:25:23.279
That Huzhou silk dress is lovely.

00:25:23.279 --> 00:25:25.440
It reminds me of something from years ago.

00:25:26.039 --> 00:25:26.759
Back then,

00:25:26.759 --> 00:25:28.240
When we were in Yongning,

00:25:28.759 --> 00:25:30.480
Miss Xie's fiance

00:25:30.480 --> 00:25:31.640
Didn't want anyone else

00:25:31.640 --> 00:25:33.200
Wearing the same fabric as her,

00:25:33.799 --> 00:25:35.440
So he bought up

00:25:35.440 --> 00:25:37.079
Every bolt of Huzhou silk in the city.

00:25:37.279 --> 00:25:38.559
He spared no expense.

00:25:38.680 --> 00:25:40.960
He cherished her above all else.

00:25:41.359 --> 00:25:42.680
There's no comparison.

00:25:42.960 --> 00:25:44.480
Miss Xie's fiance

00:25:44.480 --> 00:25:46.319
Is the renowned Commander Zhao.

00:25:46.519 --> 00:25:47.759
Their social standing

00:25:48.039 --> 00:25:49.400
Is worlds apart.

00:25:50.160 --> 00:25:52.000
Commander Zhao, the one who drove Li Mao to his death?

00:25:52.240 --> 00:25:53.160
I thought

00:25:53.240 --> 00:25:54.759
He wasn't engaged.

00:25:55.200 --> 00:25:56.400
I heard

00:25:56.400 --> 00:25:58.160
That Miss Xie's so-called fiance

00:25:58.160 --> 00:26:00.200
No longer acknowledges their engagement.

00:26:00.519 --> 00:26:02.240
Miss Xie may be highborn,

00:26:02.559 --> 00:26:04.160
But Miss Wu here

00:26:04.279 --> 00:26:06.759
Was graciously given a chance by Young Madam to display her talent

00:26:06.759 --> 00:26:08.519
By painting at today's banquet

00:26:08.640 --> 00:26:10.319
And capturing the celebration.

00:26:12.359 --> 00:26:13.759
But in this painting,

00:26:14.920 --> 00:26:16.400
Why don't I see Miss Xie?

00:26:23.079 --> 00:26:23.839
How dare you.

00:26:25.359 --> 00:26:26.559
Madam,

00:26:26.960 --> 00:26:28.200
The paper is limited in size.

00:26:28.400 --> 00:26:30.079
To capture the elegance

00:26:30.079 --> 00:26:31.119
Of all the distinguished ladies here,

00:26:31.440 --> 00:26:32.240
I had no choice

00:26:34.599 --> 00:26:36.079
But to leave a few people out.

00:26:37.880 --> 00:26:39.119
In that case,

00:26:40.599 --> 00:26:42.000
Use a larger sheet

00:26:42.000 --> 00:26:43.079
And paint it again.

00:26:45.519 --> 00:26:46.759
Young Madam, please understand.

00:26:47.240 --> 00:26:48.720
For today's painting

00:26:48.720 --> 00:26:50.960
To be worthy of the ladies gathered here,

00:26:51.319 --> 00:26:53.000
I specifically chose the rarest

00:26:53.000 --> 00:26:54.079
Bailu Xuan paper.

00:26:55.079 --> 00:26:56.240
This paper is extremely valuable,

00:26:56.480 --> 00:26:58.039
And this is already the largest sheet available.

00:26:58.039 --> 00:26:58.920
Any other sheet

00:26:58.920 --> 00:27:00.319
Would only be smaller.

00:27:01.119 --> 00:27:03.160
Unfortunately, Miss Wu's skill is still lacking,

00:27:03.400 --> 00:27:04.559
So today's painting

00:27:05.079 --> 00:27:06.680
Will simply have to leave a few people out.

00:27:09.160 --> 00:27:10.039
Everyone here

00:27:10.039 --> 00:27:11.440
Is an honored guest of the Yu family.

00:27:11.839 --> 00:27:12.960
How could our neighboring ladies

00:27:13.079 --> 00:27:14.279
Possibly be left out?

00:27:14.799 --> 00:27:16.480
Ladies holding imperial titles

00:27:16.839 --> 00:27:18.079
And the mistresses of the great households

00:27:18.240 --> 00:27:19.039
Must, of course,

00:27:19.039 --> 00:27:20.160
All be included.

00:27:21.440 --> 00:27:22.680
With Li Mao dead,

00:27:23.319 --> 00:27:25.000
Commander Zhao will be in danger himself.

00:27:26.559 --> 00:27:27.599
In this picture,

00:27:29.079 --> 00:27:30.279
There is no place for you.

00:27:33.160 --> 00:27:34.759
I hope you'll forgive us, Miss Xie.

00:27:34.839 --> 00:27:37.480
We can have Miss Wu paint your portrait another day.

00:27:38.160 --> 00:27:39.559
A painting depends on

00:27:39.559 --> 00:27:41.000
Placement and emphasis.

00:27:41.519 --> 00:27:43.640
Adding or removing a figure is hardly difficult.

00:27:44.599 --> 00:27:45.839
With your skill,

00:27:45.839 --> 00:27:46.799
Surely you know that.

00:27:47.200 --> 00:27:48.519
If you know it, yet claim you can't do it,

00:27:48.519 --> 00:27:49.480
Then I imagine

00:27:49.480 --> 00:27:50.759
There's another reason.

00:27:52.119 --> 00:27:54.319
The Yu family invited me here today,

00:27:54.880 --> 00:27:56.519
Which makes me your guest.

00:27:57.359 --> 00:27:58.920
Yet now you coerce others

00:27:59.119 --> 00:28:00.799
To humiliate a guest in public.

00:28:01.559 --> 00:28:02.640
Young Madam Yu,

00:28:02.920 --> 00:28:04.559
Is this how your family treats its guests?

00:28:11.160 --> 00:28:12.640
Poor painting skills are one thing,

00:28:13.200 --> 00:28:14.759
But ranking people by status

00:28:14.759 --> 00:28:16.039
And comparing their husbands' offices?

00:28:16.519 --> 00:28:17.480
How improper.

00:28:17.759 --> 00:28:19.440
I was thoughtless.

00:28:19.519 --> 00:28:20.640
Please forgive me, Young Madam.

00:28:22.160 --> 00:28:23.960
I'll redo the composition

00:28:24.880 --> 00:28:26.119
And include

00:28:26.440 --> 00:28:27.359
All the ladies present.

00:28:29.079 --> 00:28:29.880
Go on, then.

00:28:32.079 --> 00:28:32.839
Zhao Ling

00:28:32.839 --> 00:28:33.960
Exceeded his authority

00:28:33.960 --> 00:28:34.880
And overstepped the court's laws.

00:28:35.000 --> 00:28:36.200
Under the law,

00:28:36.200 --> 00:28:37.480
He should be dismissed and investigated.

00:28:40.160 --> 00:28:41.079
Summon Zhao Ling.

00:28:41.319 --> 00:28:43.400
Summon Zhao Ling!

00:28:51.960 --> 00:28:52.920
Your Majesty,

00:28:53.759 --> 00:28:55.200
I resorted to extraordinary measures

00:28:55.400 --> 00:28:56.480
And used torture to extract a confession.

00:28:57.039 --> 00:28:58.079
I know I overstepped my authority.

00:29:00.880 --> 00:29:02.440
(Grand Secretary Tian, Grand Academician of Wenhua Hall)

00:29:04.640 --> 00:29:05.319
However,

00:29:05.960 --> 00:29:07.119
The convicted official Li Mao

00:29:07.440 --> 00:29:08.599
Repented on his deathbed

00:29:10.880 --> 00:29:12.039
And confessed to his crimes.

00:29:12.559 --> 00:29:15.079
(Memorial: Gandu Military Embezzlement) He also wrote down his co-conspirators.

00:29:16.480 --> 00:29:18.119
I await Your Majesty's judgment.

00:29:18.240 --> 00:29:19.279
Li Mao confessed?

00:29:19.599 --> 00:29:21.160
If he did, why would he kill himself?

00:29:21.160 --> 00:29:22.279
Exactly.

00:29:46.599 --> 00:29:48.240
There is something you don't know.

00:29:49.279 --> 00:29:50.240
Zhao Ling

00:29:52.279 --> 00:29:53.880
Received a secret edict from me.

00:29:54.319 --> 00:29:55.839
That is why he came to the capital.

00:29:56.880 --> 00:29:58.920
As for the charge that he investigated beyond his authority,

00:29:59.720 --> 00:30:00.880
You have

00:30:02.119 --> 00:30:03.039
Wrongly accused him.

00:30:08.519 --> 00:30:10.319
I know you were eager to solve the case

00:30:10.599 --> 00:30:12.119
And acted before reporting to the Ministry of Justice.

00:30:13.519 --> 00:30:15.400
But the court has laws and procedures.

00:30:15.599 --> 00:30:17.279
If I hadn't protected you today,

00:30:17.279 --> 00:30:18.720
What would you have done?

00:30:23.920 --> 00:30:24.720
I deserve death.

00:30:25.200 --> 00:30:26.480
Your Majesty protected me today,

00:30:27.759 --> 00:30:28.960
Just as you did in Yongning

00:30:29.920 --> 00:30:31.720
When you forgave me for concealing my identity.

00:30:32.279 --> 00:30:32.880
I am

00:30:33.680 --> 00:30:34.680
Deeply grateful for Your Majesty's mercy.

00:30:36.599 --> 00:30:38.079
You've changed greatly

00:30:38.079 --> 00:30:39.240
From the man you were a few years ago.

00:30:40.559 --> 00:30:43.160
I intend to thoroughly investigate corruption in the salt administration.

00:30:43.160 --> 00:30:44.759
If Li Mao's confession

00:30:44.759 --> 00:30:46.039
Can serve as a warning,

00:30:46.160 --> 00:30:47.480
Perhaps those corrupt officials

00:30:47.480 --> 00:30:48.759
Will learn to rein themselves in.

00:30:49.480 --> 00:30:50.240
However,

00:30:50.440 --> 00:30:51.559
This assignment

00:30:51.880 --> 00:30:52.880
Will make you enemies.

00:30:53.200 --> 00:30:53.920
If you fail,

00:30:54.119 --> 00:30:55.480
It could cost you your head.

00:30:55.920 --> 00:30:56.640
Will you take it?

00:30:58.839 --> 00:31:00.400
I will give it everything I have

00:31:00.640 --> 00:31:01.680
And not fail Your Majesty's trust.

00:31:02.279 --> 00:31:02.799
Good.

00:31:03.359 --> 00:31:04.240
Then remember this.

00:31:04.559 --> 00:31:06.119
You returned to the capital by imperial command

00:31:06.319 --> 00:31:07.599
With special authority to make arrests.

00:31:12.799 --> 00:31:13.839
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:31:15.520 --> 00:31:16.960
(Yu Residence)

00:31:16.960 --> 00:31:18.000
The auspicious hour has arrived.

00:31:18.279 --> 00:31:19.799
Let the first-birthday choosing ceremony begin.

00:31:25.880 --> 00:31:27.400
In other families,

00:31:27.400 --> 00:31:28.759
The child's mother usually holds him for the ceremony.

00:31:29.200 --> 00:31:30.160
So why, in the Yu family,

00:31:30.160 --> 00:31:31.640
Is Madam Yu presiding?

00:31:32.119 --> 00:31:33.759
You think Young Madam Yu doesn't want to?

00:31:33.960 --> 00:31:34.880
In this family,

00:31:34.880 --> 00:31:36.400
Madam Yu is still the one in charge.

00:31:36.480 --> 00:31:38.359
She could bear ten children and it wouldn't matter.

00:31:38.440 --> 00:31:39.319
There can only be

00:31:39.319 --> 00:31:40.480
One true matriarch of the house.

00:31:41.160 --> 00:31:43.359
Today is my grandson Ji's first birthday.

00:31:43.680 --> 00:31:46.279
Thank you all for joining us to celebrate.

00:31:46.559 --> 00:31:48.240
If anything has been lacking in our hospitality,

00:31:48.599 --> 00:31:49.839
I hope you'll forgive us.

00:31:50.960 --> 00:31:52.599
Just look at the boy.

00:31:52.720 --> 00:31:54.519
That high nose, those big eyes...

00:31:54.519 --> 00:31:55.440
He looks

00:31:55.440 --> 00:31:57.319
Just like Madam Yu.

00:31:57.400 --> 00:31:58.440
No wonder they say

00:31:58.440 --> 00:31:59.759
Grandparents and grandchildren share a special bond.

00:32:00.000 --> 00:32:02.079
The young master takes after his grandmother,

00:32:02.279 --> 00:32:02.920
So one day

00:32:02.920 --> 00:32:04.400
He'll surely be especially devoted to her.

00:32:05.119 --> 00:32:06.640
Indeed.

00:32:07.680 --> 00:32:08.799
How adorable.

00:32:09.240 --> 00:32:10.359
Now let's see

00:32:10.359 --> 00:32:12.200
What future little Ji chooses for himself.

00:32:13.319 --> 00:32:14.920
First, the longevity lock.

00:32:14.920 --> 00:32:15.759
Good health,

00:32:15.759 --> 00:32:16.559
Long life,

00:32:16.559 --> 00:32:17.720
And lasting blessings.

00:32:22.920 --> 00:32:24.680
Second, the golden spoon.

00:32:25.079 --> 00:32:27.519
A lifetime of wealth and honor.

00:32:31.279 --> 00:32:32.880
Third, the calligraphy brush.

00:32:32.880 --> 00:32:34.319
Intelligence and a love of learning,

00:32:34.319 --> 00:32:35.519
With a bright future ahead.

00:32:35.759 --> 00:32:38.000
Congratulations, Madam Yu.

00:32:38.000 --> 00:32:39.440
Congratulations to the Yu family.

00:32:39.440 --> 00:32:42.039
That boy is clearly destined to carry on the family legacy.

00:32:42.039 --> 00:32:43.559
He'll surely make something of himself.

00:32:46.160 --> 00:32:46.880
Reward them.

00:32:51.319 --> 00:32:52.880
(Jiuxiao Banquet Hall) When I was still Crown Prince,

00:32:53.200 --> 00:32:55.240
You enlisted with my letter of introduction.

00:32:56.000 --> 00:32:57.079
Over the past five years,

00:32:57.240 --> 00:32:58.839
You've led your troops to victory time and again

00:32:59.400 --> 00:33:00.400
And handled

00:33:00.720 --> 00:33:02.160
This case exceptionally well.

00:33:02.640 --> 00:33:03.519
It seems

00:33:04.279 --> 00:33:05.799
I was right about you.

00:33:07.440 --> 00:33:08.359
Zhao Ling,

00:33:09.160 --> 00:33:09.880
You deserve a reward.

00:33:10.279 --> 00:33:12.960
Senior fourth-rank Assistant Commander of the Capital Guard.

00:33:13.720 --> 00:33:14.519
Do you like it?

00:33:16.160 --> 00:33:17.079
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:33:17.960 --> 00:33:18.720
Rise.

00:33:19.160 --> 00:33:20.640
He's been promoted to fourth-rank?

00:33:20.640 --> 00:33:22.000
Yes. That was fast.

00:33:22.279 --> 00:33:23.359
Zhao,

00:33:24.119 --> 00:33:25.160
Do you have a courtesy name?

00:33:26.079 --> 00:33:26.880
Your Majesty,

00:33:27.119 --> 00:33:28.279
My parents died when I was young,

00:33:28.400 --> 00:33:29.279
So I was never given one.

00:33:33.920 --> 00:33:35.519
I have little learning,

00:33:36.240 --> 00:33:37.519
So I ask Your Majesty to bestow one upon me.

00:33:38.559 --> 00:33:41.440
You certainly know how to seize an opportunity.

00:33:46.559 --> 00:33:48.000
Huchen.

00:33:53.000 --> 00:33:54.039
How do you like

00:33:54.839 --> 00:33:55.720
That courtesy name?

00:33:56.079 --> 00:33:56.920
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:34:00.039 --> 00:34:01.480
So when do we get to celebrate

00:34:01.480 --> 00:34:03.079
Your marriage to Miss Xie?

00:34:05.400 --> 00:34:06.240
She is

00:34:07.480 --> 00:34:09.519
At a banquet at the Yu Residence right now.

00:34:12.079 --> 00:34:14.039
Then go with Minister Yu

00:34:14.199 --> 00:34:15.800
And bring your sweetheart home.

00:34:17.719 --> 00:34:18.239
Yes.

00:34:26.719 --> 00:34:28.079
Come, sit. Please.

00:34:28.840 --> 00:34:30.800
It's been so long since we've all been together.

00:34:30.800 --> 00:34:31.440
Sit here.

00:34:31.440 --> 00:34:32.360
Forgive my poor hospitality.

00:34:32.679 --> 00:34:33.880
Please make yourselves at home.

00:34:34.039 --> 00:34:35.239
I'll sit right beside you.

00:34:35.840 --> 00:34:37.280
We can finally catch up properly today.

00:34:37.280 --> 00:34:38.239
Exactly.

00:34:38.239 --> 00:34:39.440
Then let me offer a few toasts first.

00:34:39.559 --> 00:34:40.119
Here.

00:34:42.320 --> 00:34:43.679
No need to be so formal with me.

00:34:43.679 --> 00:34:44.880
So graceful and elegant.

00:34:46.840 --> 00:34:48.519
A true lady of good breeding.

00:34:48.519 --> 00:34:50.000
What were you thinking?

00:34:50.000 --> 00:34:51.880
Miss Xie is an honored guest I personally invited.

00:34:51.880 --> 00:34:53.199
Why was she seated at the last table?

00:34:53.960 --> 00:34:55.039
Mother,

00:34:55.280 --> 00:34:57.440
Mozhan arranged the seating according to precedent.

00:34:58.039 --> 00:34:59.559
I should have thought it through more carefully.

00:34:59.559 --> 00:35:00.400
Ridiculous.

00:35:07.480 --> 00:35:08.440
Miss Xie.

00:35:10.079 --> 00:35:10.559
Come.

00:35:10.840 --> 00:35:12.199
Sit beside me.

00:35:14.480 --> 00:35:15.880
We haven't seen each other in years.

00:35:16.000 --> 00:35:17.760
We have so much to catch up on.

00:35:18.239 --> 00:35:18.760
Come.

00:35:26.599 --> 00:35:27.239
Madam Yu,

00:35:27.719 --> 00:35:29.280
I'm afraid such an honor is more than I deserve.

00:35:29.920 --> 00:35:30.679
Have a seat.

00:35:42.199 --> 00:35:44.079
Miss Xie, perhaps you haven't heard.

00:35:44.480 --> 00:35:46.119
At the palace banquet just now,

00:35:46.119 --> 00:35:48.639
His Majesty bestowed the courtesy name Huchen upon Commander Zhao

00:35:48.639 --> 00:35:49.639
And granted him special permission

00:35:49.639 --> 00:35:50.840
To remain in the capital as an official.

00:35:51.000 --> 00:35:52.679
From a regional post to the capital,

00:35:52.679 --> 00:35:54.280
He's certainly risen fast.

00:35:54.639 --> 00:35:55.440
From now on,

00:35:55.440 --> 00:35:57.119
You'll both be staying in the capital.

00:35:57.239 --> 00:35:59.760
His Majesty even mentioned your marriage just now.

00:36:00.320 --> 00:36:01.880
Come sit closer

00:36:01.880 --> 00:36:03.119
And tell me all about it.

00:36:03.519 --> 00:36:04.800
Thank you for telling me, Madam.

00:36:05.079 --> 00:36:06.280
I'm deeply grateful for His Majesty's favor.

00:36:07.039 --> 00:36:09.039
Then congratulations are certainly in order.

00:36:09.119 --> 00:36:11.480
Looks like you backed the right man.

00:36:11.760 --> 00:36:13.320
Miss Xie and Commander Zhao

00:36:13.320 --> 00:36:14.760
Truly are devoted to each other.

00:36:15.519 --> 00:36:15.960
Here.

00:36:16.320 --> 00:36:17.800
A toast to Miss Xie.

00:36:17.960 --> 00:36:19.199
Congratulations!

00:36:19.199 --> 00:36:20.079
Congratulations!

00:36:41.159 --> 00:36:42.239
Who would've thought

00:36:42.920 --> 00:36:44.239
Things would turn around so suddenly?

00:36:44.519 --> 00:36:45.840
Miss Xie

00:36:46.199 --> 00:36:47.440
Is clearly no ordinary woman.

00:36:59.719 --> 00:37:00.719
Five years ago,

00:37:01.039 --> 00:37:01.960
You told me

00:37:02.639 --> 00:37:04.199
I could spend ten years,

00:37:05.280 --> 00:37:06.760
Even decades,

00:37:07.719 --> 00:37:10.039
To reach your father's level.

00:37:11.599 --> 00:37:13.639
So how far have I climbed now?

00:37:16.880 --> 00:37:18.239
Am I high enough

00:37:19.000 --> 00:37:20.159
To sit

00:37:20.280 --> 00:37:21.760
At the same table as your father?

00:37:23.960 --> 00:37:25.360
I'd rather know

00:37:26.719 --> 00:37:29.360
Whether she likes the man you've become.

00:37:31.760 --> 00:37:32.760
Have the two of you

00:37:33.679 --> 00:37:35.039
Set a wedding date yet?

00:37:38.679 --> 00:37:40.920
That's none of your concern.

00:38:00.280 --> 00:38:02.280
I was occupied in the rear rooms just now

00:38:03.199 --> 00:38:05.440
And didn't know my daughter-in-law had offended you in the main hall.

00:38:06.519 --> 00:38:08.079
I failed to keep her in line.

00:38:08.400 --> 00:38:10.159
Please forgive us, Miss Xie.

00:38:10.599 --> 00:38:11.760
I hope this

00:38:12.119 --> 00:38:14.159
Won't damage the bond we've shared all these years.

00:38:14.480 --> 00:38:16.679
I took a liking to you back in Huaying,

00:38:17.320 --> 00:38:18.800
And it seems fate has brought us together again.

00:38:19.119 --> 00:38:20.800
Why don't we put our age difference aside

00:38:20.800 --> 00:38:22.000
And just be friends?

00:38:22.159 --> 00:38:24.039
You and Zhao Ling are new to the capital.

00:38:24.519 --> 00:38:26.400
It would be good for us to look out for one another.

00:38:32.400 --> 00:38:33.559
Surely you jest, Madam.

00:38:34.920 --> 00:38:35.960
Yake and I

00:38:35.960 --> 00:38:37.280
Grew up together.

00:38:37.840 --> 00:38:39.920
If I were to treat her mother-in-law as my peer,

00:38:40.760 --> 00:38:41.920
Where would that

00:38:42.039 --> 00:38:43.239
Leave Yake?

00:38:46.239 --> 00:38:47.960
It was my daughter-in-law

00:38:48.119 --> 00:38:49.760
Who hurt you back then.

00:38:51.280 --> 00:38:52.840
Was Yake the only one who hurt me?

00:38:58.639 --> 00:39:00.079
When Young Lord Yu

00:39:00.079 --> 00:39:01.480
Came to Ganlin on his inspection,

00:39:01.480 --> 00:39:03.239
The matter of those four written confessions

00:39:03.679 --> 00:39:05.039
Was settled once and for all.

00:39:08.960 --> 00:39:10.320
Four?

00:39:15.519 --> 00:39:16.840
Allow me one word of advice today

00:39:17.000 --> 00:39:18.960
To Commander Zhao.

00:39:19.039 --> 00:39:21.400
Be more careful from now on.

00:39:22.320 --> 00:39:23.920
There's more to the capital

00:39:24.360 --> 00:39:25.519
Than meets the eye.

00:39:26.000 --> 00:39:27.760
Don't let one impulsive move

00:39:27.760 --> 00:39:29.199
Cost you everything you've built.

00:39:31.079 --> 00:39:31.760
Please.

00:39:34.960 --> 00:39:35.960
(May Virtue and Grace Endure)

00:39:35.960 --> 00:39:36.519
Let's go.

00:39:38.440 --> 00:39:39.519
Good thing we brought umbrellas.

00:39:40.079 --> 00:39:41.920
Look how hard it's raining.

00:39:44.360 --> 00:39:45.760
Look. Who's that over there?

00:39:47.159 --> 00:39:47.880
Who?

00:40:08.320 --> 00:40:13.760
♪Once a bird among the clouds, now fallen into the mortal world♪

00:40:13.760 --> 00:40:20.640
♪Inviting frost to my temples, veiling the face of bygone days♪

00:40:20.640 --> 00:40:26.720
♪With a feather in my beak, I brave the storm away every false accusation♪

00:40:26.720 --> 00:40:33.560
♪May all common folk share one roof, every lantern rest in peace♪

00:40:33.560 --> 00:40:35.960
♪Let this humble name carry me♪

00:40:35.960 --> 00:40:37.000
It's Commander Zhao.

00:40:38.840 --> 00:40:45.841
♪With wit and strategy, I enter this game without regret♪

00:40:45.880 --> 00:40:48.440
♪Let the past remain beyond recall♪

00:40:48.440 --> 00:40:51.000
♪In exchange for boundless skies♪

00:40:52.120 --> 00:40:54.640
(Next Episode)

00:40:55.519 --> 00:40:56.920
(The struggle for power at court)

00:40:57.400 --> 00:40:58.880
(is like rowing against the current.)

00:40:59.519 --> 00:41:00.719
(If you don't move forward, you fall behind.)

00:41:01.480 --> 00:41:03.000
(There's a staircase before me.)

00:41:03.760 --> 00:41:05.519
(I have no choice but to keep climbing,)

00:41:06.280 --> 00:41:07.360
(all the way to the top.)

00:41:07.920 --> 00:41:09.440
Only by standing high enough

00:41:09.719 --> 00:41:11.840
Can I truly protect us

00:41:12.599 --> 00:41:14.719
From the storm of arrows aimed our way.

00:41:15.320 --> 00:41:17.039
Since it's come to this,

00:41:17.159 --> 00:41:18.559
From now on, our two families

00:41:19.239 --> 00:41:21.119
Will fight until one of us falls.

00:41:21.320 --> 00:41:22.639
I've set the stage for you.

00:41:23.239 --> 00:41:24.960
From here on out, you'll have

00:41:25.639 --> 00:41:26.760
Plenty of people willing to do the dirty work.

00:41:39.480 --> 00:41:43.800
♪The past brushes by like a falling leaf♪

00:41:47.400 --> 00:41:51.760
♪So light, yet my steps still pause for you♪

00:41:53.880 --> 00:41:58.520
♪Through every rise and fall, our memories remain without regret♪

00:41:58.760 --> 00:42:01.560
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

00:42:02.720 --> 00:42:07.360
♪How I wish I could stay a little longer, but I can't♪

00:42:10.560 --> 00:42:17.400
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill my eyes with tears♪

00:42:18.280 --> 00:42:24.800
♪Etched deep within my heart, yet buried without a word♪

00:42:25.760 --> 00:42:29.200
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

00:42:29.720 --> 00:42:33.920
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

00:42:34.200 --> 00:42:39.880
♪One promise for a lifetime, echoing long after we part♪

00:42:52.000 --> 00:42:55.880
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you in the crowd♪

00:42:59.800 --> 00:43:03.800
♪Without a word, you lit up half my life♪

00:43:05.520 --> 00:43:10.200
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

00:43:10.520 --> 00:43:13.200
♪Kept close within my heart♪

00:43:14.280 --> 00:43:19.120
♪From now on, no one else is worth waiting for♪

00:43:22.640 --> 00:43:29.560
♪I turn away, afraid no one will ever come home to me again♪

00:43:30.440 --> 00:43:36.920
♪If we can build our future together, no storm can chill my heart♪

00:43:37.800 --> 00:43:41.320
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

00:43:41.760 --> 00:43:46.120
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

00:43:46.320 --> 00:43:52.040
♪One promise for a lifetime, echoing long after we part♪

